# Symlinks into ~/Library/Caches/Riffle (see Scripts/build.sh).
.build
build
*.iconset/
.DS_Store
.claude/
# The disk image the website offers, made by Scripts/make-dmg.sh: kept out of the history, copied along at deploy.
website/download/
# The same image as an update. The feed that lists it, website/updates/appcast.xml, stays in the history: each release
# writes it again from the one before.
website/updates/*.dmg
website/updates/old_updates/

# Wrangler's local state (Cloudflare/)
.wrangler/
# The demo film's renders (Marketing/film/render.cjs): big, and made again from the source at will.
Marketing/film/out/
# Pricing and competitor research (reports and their notes): kept on this Mac, out of the repository.
reports/
research_notes/
# Notes for posting on Reddit: kept on this Mac, out of the repository.
Marketing/reddit-post.md
# Other makers' app icons, read from this Mac's own apps by Scripts/site-assets.sh: deployed from here, never shared in the repository.
website/img/apps/
